{"category_id":"6a5dd80467bf62345b1ba73f","label_id":[],"sort":1,"status":1,"type":"content","details":"<p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">高端装备制造业的稳定运行，离不开高品质轴承这一 &ldquo;工业关节&rdquo;。源自德国工业核心产区的 GRONDE 格朗德，传承德国百年精密制造底蕴，严格对标一线德系轴承制造标准，专注高端工业轴承研发、生产与配套服务。<\/p>\n<div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; text-indent: 2em;\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">GRONDE 格朗德全系列产品遵循德国 DIN 工业制造体系，坚守<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box;\">高精度、高稳定性、长使用寿命<\/span>核心产品理念。品牌选用真空电渣重熔高纯净轴承钢材，配套微米级滚道超精研磨工艺；产品历经上万次疲劳极限测试、高低温交变测试、重载冲击可靠性测试，将严苛制造标准落地至每一颗轴承的生产工序。<\/p>\n<div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; text-indent: 2em;\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">面向风电、矿山、冶金、轨道交通、工程机械、工业电机、通用重工等重点领域，GRONDE 格朗德持续提供高可靠性核心运转部件，凭借稳定品质与合理成本优势，成为市场极具竞争力的德系精工轴承代表品牌。未来，品牌将持续立足德系制造优势，持续为重工行业装备稳定运转保驾护航。<\/p>","title":"根植德国精密制造产区 GRONDE 格朗德以 DIN 标准深耕高端工业轴承赛道","bg_img":"https:\/\/oss.lcweb01.cn\/jzt\/6a5d900c3b7c8a0bdb25998e\/image\/20260726\/297f3aea45e732cd5ac1fca06b607c7f.jpeg","column_id":"6a5dd7b35ef06b193f2b9a3a","site_id":"6a5d900c3b7c8a0bdb25998e","intro":"高端装备制造业的稳定运行，离不开高品质轴承这一 “工业关节”。源自德国工业核心产区的 GRONDE 格朗德，传承德国百年精密制造底蕴，严格对标一线德系轴承制造标准，专注高端工业轴承研发、生产与配套服务。","is_top":0,"create_time":"2026-07-23 10:29:27","update_time":"2026-08-13 18:23:37","readnum":0,"showTitleTip":false,"id":"6a617c8728be4756d77b976f","gl_list":[]}